<title>UK: BADMINTON-QUARTER-FINALS RESULTS AT ALL ENGLAND CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-QUARTER-FINALS RESULTS AT ALL ENGLAND CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, England 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on</p>
<p>quarter-finals day on Thursday at the All England badminton</p>
<p>championships (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>9/16-Heryanto Arbi (Indonesida) beat Luo Yigang (China)</p>
<p>8-15 15-9 15-6</p>
<p>9/16-Dong Jiong (China) beat Peter Rasmussen (Denmark) 15-12</p>
<p>15-8</p>
<p>Women's Singles</p>
<p>Dai Yun (China) beat 5/8-Zhang Ning (China)</p>
<p>5-11 12-11 11-8</p>
<p>3/4-Ye Zhaoying (China) beat 5-8 Kim Ji-hyun</p>
<p>(South Korea) 11-7 11-1</p>
<p>women's singles:</p>
<p>2-Gong Zhichao (China) beat 5/8-Susi</p>
<p>Susanti (Indonesia) 11-4 11-7</p>
<p>Ra Kyung-min (South Korea) beat 3/4-Camilla Martin (Denmark)</p>
<p>11-7 11-12 11-6</p>
<p>Men's singles:</p>
<p>3/4-Sun Jun (China) beat Lin Liwen (China) 15-9 15-9</p>
<p>1-Poul-Erik Hoyer-Larsen (Denmark) beat 5/8-Budi Santoso (Indonesia) 15-7 15-12</p>
</text>
